  "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Describe the bug</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A clear and concise description of what the bug is.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Affected version</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Please run <code class=\"notranslate\">gh version</code> and paste the output below.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Steps to reproduce the behavior</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Type this '...'</li>\n<li>View the output '....'</li>\n<li>See error</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Expected vs actual behavior</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A clear and concise description of what you expected to happen and what actually happened.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Logs</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Paste the activity from your command line. Redact if needed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AKME -debug-Apk</p>\n</blockquote>"
