 "https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/162304#issuecomment-7048261281": {
  "body": "Reproduced on my Windows in ~1 minute, 116 rounds.\n\nThis was once discussed in https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/130733.\n\n`multiprocessing.SimpleQueue` does not use a write lock:\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922/Lib/multiprocessing/queues.py#L392-L394\n\nThus more than one threads can write simultaneously. But `PipeConnection` supports only one pending overlapped write, which is stored in a single `_send_ov`. A second `send_bytes()` from another thread complains:\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922/Lib/multiprocessing/connection.py#L296-L299\n\nCreated a PR in https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/162335.\n",
  "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Reproduced on my Windows in ~1 minute, 116 rounds.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This was once discussed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2889039104\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/130733\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/python/cpython/issues/130733/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/130733\">#130733</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">multiprocessing.SimpleQueue</code> does not use a write lock:<br>\n</p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922/Lib/multiprocessing/queues.py#L392-L394\">cpython/Lib/multiprocessing/queues.py</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 392 to 394\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/python/cpython/commit/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922\">e0d0f2e</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L392\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"392\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC392\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">_wlock</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">is</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">None</span>: </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L393\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"393\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC393\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     <span class=\"pl-c\"># writes to a message oriented win32 pipe are atomic</span> </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L394\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"394\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC394\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     <span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">_writer</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">send_bytes</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">obj</span>) </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thus more than one threads can write simultaneously. But <code class=\"notranslate\">PipeConnection</code> supports only one pending overlapped write, which is stored in a single <code class=\"notranslate\">_send_ov</code>. A second <code class=\"notranslate\">send_bytes()</code> from another thread complains:<br>\n</p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922/Lib/multiprocessing/connection.py#L296-L299\">cpython/Lib/multiprocessing/connection.py</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n        Lines 296 to 299\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/python/cpython/commit/e0d0f2e153450cf79b84e2ec5ffbcbad8aea7922\">e0d0f2e</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L296\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"296\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC296\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">_send_ov</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">is</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">not</span></span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">None</span>: </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L297\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"297\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC297\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     <span class=\"pl-c\"># A connection should only be used by a single thread</span> </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L298\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"298\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC298\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">     <span class=\"pl-k\">raise</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">ValueError</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">\"concurrent send_bytes() calls \"</span> </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L299\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"299\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC299\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\">                      <span class=\"pl-s\">\"are not supported\"</span>) </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Created a PR in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6518338340\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/162335\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/python/cpython/pull/162335/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/162335\">#162335</a>.</p>"
 },
 "https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/161701#discussion_r4602465510": {
  "body": "Suggestions:\n\n* Check *ba* and *result* at the end\n* Use a shorter input string\n* Use a shorter test name\n* Test also bytearray.lstrip() and bytearray.rstrip()\n\n```suggestion\n    def check_strip_mutate(self, method, initial, expected):\n        ba = bytearray(initial)\n\n        class S:\n            def __buffer__(self, flags):\n                return memoryview(b\" \")\n\n            def __release_buffer__(self, view):\n                ba.clear()\n\n        meth = getattr(ba, method)\n        result = meth(S())\n        self.assertEqual(result, bytearray(expected))\n        self.assertEqual(ba, bytearray(b''))\n\n    def test_strip_mutate(self):\n        self.check_strip_mutate('strip', b'  abc  ', b'abc')\n\n    def test_lstrip_mutate(self):\n        self.check_strip_mutate('lstrip', b'  abc  ', b'abc  ')\n\n    def test_rstrip_mutate(self):\n        self.check_strip_mutate('rstrip', b'  abc  ', b'  abc')\n```",
  "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Suggestions:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Check <em>ba</em> and <em>result</em> at the end</li>\n<li>Use a shorter input string</li>\n<li>Use a shorter test name</li>\n<li>Test also bytearray.lstrip() and bytearray.rstrip()</li>\n</ul>\n  <div class=\"my-2 border rounded-2 js-suggested-changes-blob diff-view js-check-hidden-unicode\" id=\"\">\n    <div class=\"f6 p-2 lh-condensed border-bottom d-flex\">\n      <div class=\"flex-auto flex-items-center color-fg-muted\">\n        Suggested change\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"blob-wrapper data file rounded-0\" style=\"margin: 0; border: none; overflow-y: visible; overflow-x: auto;\">\n      <table class=\"d-table tab-size mb-0 width-full\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n          <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\">    <span class=\"pl-k\">def</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">test_strip_buffer_release_mutates_self</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>):</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\">        <span class=\"pl-s1\">ba</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">bytearray</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">b\"x\"</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">*</span> (<span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">22</span>))</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\"></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\">        <span class=\"pl-k\">class</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">S</span>:</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\">            <span class=\"pl-k\">def</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">__buffer__</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>, <span class=\"pl-s1\">flags</span>):</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\">                <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">memoryview</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\">b\" \"</span>)</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\"></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 p