 "https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/162262#discussion_r4646663012": {
  "body": "```suggestion\nDisable ``unicodectype.c`` optimization on WinARM64 due to a compiler bug in MSVC 14.50, 14.51 and 14.52.\n```\nThe original PR https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/153669 did use `skip-issue`, but now that tree compiler versions are affected, I agree it's worth to mention.\n\nI'd also use the `Windows` category here, even though it is a `Build` issue as well.\n",
  "bodyHTML": "  <div class=\"my-2 border rounded-2 js-suggested-changes-blob diff-view js-check-hidden-unicode\" id=\"\">\n    <div class=\"f6 p-2 lh-condensed border-bottom d-flex\">\n      <div class=\"flex-auto flex-items-center color-fg-muted\">\n        Suggested change\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"blob-wrapper data file rounded-0\" style=\"margin: 0; border: none; overflow-y: visible; overflow-x: auto;\">\n      <table class=\"d-table tab-size mb-0 width-full\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n          <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-deletion text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-deletion js-blob-code-deletion blob-code-marker-deletion\"><span class=\"x x-first x-last\">Apply the existing </span>``<span class=\"pl-c1\">unicodectype.c</span>`` optimization <span class=\"x x-first x-last\">workaround </span>to <span class=\"x x-first x-last\">Windows</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"border-0\">\n            <td class=\"blob-num blob-num-addition text-right border-0 px-2 py-1 lh-default blob-num-hidden\" data-line-number=\"\u00b7\"></td>\n            <td class=\"border-0 px-2 py-1 blob-code-inner blob-code-addition js-blob-code-addition blob-code-marker-addition\"><span class=\"x x-first x-last\">Disable </span>``<span class=\"pl-c1\">unicodectype.c</span>`` optimization <span class=\"x x-first x-last\">on WinARM64 due </span>to <span class=\"x x-first x-last\">a compiler bug in MSVC 14.50, 14.51 and 14.52.</span></td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody></table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"js-apply-changes\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">The original PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4876170907\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/153669\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/python/cpython/pull/153669/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/153669\">#153669</a> did use <code class=\"notranslate\">skip-issue</code>, but now that tree compiler versions are affected, I agree it's worth to mention.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'd also use the <code class=\"notranslate\">Windows</code> category here, even though it is a <code class=\"notranslate\">Build</code> issue as well.</p>"
 }
